stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Backup completion precedes independent copy completion
accDescr: A completed source backup starts a separate cross-Region copy job. Either job can fail and trigger an alert, and only a completed copy establishes a destination recovery point.
[*] --> BackupRunning
state "Source backup running" as BackupRunning
state "Source recovery point ready" as SourceReady
state "Cross-Region copy running" as CopyRunning
state "Destination recovery point ready" as DestinationReady
state "Notify unsuccessful job" as Alert
BackupRunning --> SourceReady: Backup completed
BackupRunning --> Alert: Backup unsuccessful
SourceReady --> CopyRunning: Native copy action
CopyRunning --> DestinationReady: Copy completed
CopyRunning --> Alert: Copy unsuccessful
DestinationReady --> [*]
Alert --> [*]
